'''Baron Face''' (カオ男爵, ''Kao Danshaku'', '''Baron Face''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of [[Shy Boy]] introduced in [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] stages. He was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Baron Face
|image = E 753.png
|first appearance = [[Anniversary/13th Year#Ep. 5: The Archrivals' Return|Ep. 5: The Archrivals' Return]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
This conspiring noble's plan of attack is simple. Much like [[Wicked Face|other]] [[the Face|faceoids]] of his kind, he stays in the back and progressively chips away at your frontlines with high-damage attacks, punishing any cats that get too close. He has a knockback count of two, giving him better survivability than The Face at the cost of less overall bulk. Though seemingly weak in stats, he is buffed immensely in later encounters. As matter of fact, this may not even be his final form at all...

==Strategy==
Baron Face is luckily outranged by both [[Fedora Cat (Special Cat)|Blue Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]], making them an excellent source of DPS/crowd-control against him. Once permanently Frozen with two Green Nyanko Rangers, you're free to utilize more spammable attackers like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to expedite his demise and wave this wicked baron goodbye, for now at least.

